<title>UK: Alliance &amp; Leicester to float April 21.</title>
<headline>Alliance &amp; Leicester to float April 21.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Alliance &amp; Leicester Building Society confirmed on Wednesday that it will float on the London Stock Exchange on April 21, issuing 582 million shares.</p>
</text>
